&_nc_oc=AdntgsE11wNzsV4-uiCdaGmBGjBvl1Swwa-Dv6kxwREQmrlpgdSyTo0scPkMyqH8Dtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftyT5biEWLHgHrRb5vSozdnu5cl-fvgNYwqkx2dPDvvlg&oe=699D9F5E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1819228061920273", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_1819228065253606_407037206585227872_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yW8fnJ04nq4Q7kNvwH2tFVz&_nc_oc=AdlngR5FZiZ7CnGa3yXrR5G425ZpSf1LY0lzSC8dIbs4QaoexNB5cI0hNSZ5RIpfvOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv0OihDtUyoeZhyWwjL2n0mUDd8rrwthf_Gakj-RrVdfA&oe=699DB4CA"}, "display_name": "Pinfall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Pinfall\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport.\nGame Overview\n\n\"Pinfall\" is a cutting-edge VR game that redefines the bowling experience by placing players in a vibrant cosmic arena. The game challenges your precision, skill, and timing as you aim to score points by knocking down pins in various celestial-themed lanes. Each game session offers a unique adventure, filled with stunning visuals and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Pinfall: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Pinfall,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters the realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Pinfall\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport."}]}, "dev